from report_engine import *

def review(name,link,purpose,strength,seo,ux,ui,content,action):
 sub(name);url(link);p('<b>Purpose:</b> '+purpose,'small');p('<b>Strengths:</b> '+strength,'small');p('<b>SEO:</b> '+seo,'small');p('<b>UX:</b> '+ux,'small');p('<b>UI / design:</b> '+ui,'small');p('<b>Content:</b> '+content,'small');p('<b>Recommended change:</b> '+action,'small');story.append(Spacer(1,9))

page('13. Page-by-page findings',13,kicker='HOME AND CORE SERVICE OFFER')
review('Homepage','https://nextro.hu/','Introduce NEXTRO, route service enquiries and expose the shop.','Broad offer, explicit phone/email on desktop, distinct primary navigation and repeated quote access. Raw HTML and metadata describe HVAC clearly.','Slogan-only H1 is less topical than the title; no distinct destinations from service cards, and four learn-more links return home. Large background images are the main payload issue.','Repeated experience/quality/speed sections and flip cards increase scanning effort. The apparent sector links do not navigate.','Coherent palette and large CTA; some CTA text fails 4.5:1. Mobile consent dominates the first viewport and the phone strip disappears.','Useful process explanation, but claims and anonymous project summaries need proof. Counters animate correctly when brought into view; the initial zeros are not a confirmed defect.','F04–F08, F14, F17: explicit offer heading, fewer repeated benefits, real context-preserving service/sector links, approved cases and optimized imagery.')
review('Services','https://nextro.hu/szolgaltatasok/','Explain the service portfolio and generate qualified enquiries.','Ten service areas and useful practical FAQs; title and description are present. One responsible-partner story is easy to understand.','One hub carries many different intents; there are no deep service landing pages in the discovered commercial set. H1 “Szolgáltatásaink” is generic.','The overview helps orientation but makes maintenance/filter prospects scan all services. Main links are predominantly generic contact actions.','Dark hero checklist text measured 1.82:1; an unnamed overlay link is focusable. Mobile card copy is 14 px.','Service descriptions are credible summaries, but need deliverables, suitability, scheduling, exclusions and linked case proof on detail pages.','F04, F07, F11, F23: fix hero/link semantics; add jump links, expand three priority service intents and attach a contextual enquiry to each.')
page('Page findings: solutions and references',kicker='FIT AND PROOF')
review('Industry and residential solutions','https://nextro.hu/megoldasok/','Help visitors identify a solution relevant to their building/sector.','Differentiates hotel comfort, kitchen extraction, wellness humidity, industrial operations and residential needs. FAQs explain practical constraints.','Hotel/Wellness use H2 while peer sectors use H3; no dedicated sector detail URLs found. Title is descriptive and metadata is present.','General four-stage process appears before sector detail; no immediate sector index was observed. Generic links do not preserve industry context.','Consistent hero styling, but the dark checklist inherits the same visually weak treatment seen on related templates.','Sector copy is more customer-oriented than generic slogans, but short summaries do not establish delivery evidence or sector-specific scopes.','F04, F07, F11, F17: add a sector jump index, equal H2 levels, service/case links and a “this sector” quote path. Expand separate pages only with substantive content.')
review('References','https://nextro.hu/referenciak/','Provide evidence that NEXTRO has delivered comparable work.','Lists industrial, hotel, kitchen and expansion work and explains the technical scope rather than showing logos alone.','Unique title/description; the missing opportunity is substantive project content, not a missing meta tag. No case-study URLs were discovered.','A buyer cannot evaluate an identifiable comparable project, date, constraints or documented outcome. The only main CTA is generic contact.','Filter-product imagery leads the page even though the headline promise is completed project experience. This weakens visual relevance.','Anonymous project-type labels and partner/volume claims are not independent evidence. They may be true, but the page does not demonstrate them.','F08: create three permission-cleared cases with original project images, date/context/scope and documented results; link each to relevant services. Explicitly label confidential cases.')
page('Page findings: about and contact',kicker='CREDIBILITY AND ENQUIRY')
review('About NEXTRO','https://nextro.hu/rolunk/','Establish company expertise, stability and working methods.','Foundation year, in-house trades, team size, manufacturer role and a named financial-rating provider give a useful company story.','Title and description exist; tenure wording can age badly. Add verified entity/contact details to the shared schema rather than more generic keywords.','Claims are repeated more than demonstrated; there is no obvious named expert/team introduction in the inspected main content.','Current navy/green style, with the related low-contrast checklist. The page would gain credibility from actual team/facility imagery and verified badges.','20 years / nearly 20 / more than 20 is inconsistent with references’ 21-year language. AA+ and top 1.1% claims need current evidence and dates.','F08, F18, F20: use “2005 óta,” show accountable people and qualification evidence, and link current rating verification. Do not infer the rating is false simply because proof is missing.')
review('Contact','https://nextro.hu/kapcsolat/','Accept quotations, faults, service and filter enquiries.','Phone/email links work as tel/mailto destinations; registered and warehouse/correspondence addresses are clearly distinguished. Labels and enquiry types are useful.','Title/description are specific; H1→H3 section jump is inconsistent and OG image is absent. Local listing accuracy outside the site was not verified.','Phone and email are both required by the plugin’s ARIA state; separate subject/type fields add burden. Response time remains vague. Terms/privacy links lead to placeholders.','Inputs are 16 px on mobile and fit the viewport. Contact links have 3.49:1 contrast and are color-only within prose.','No approved visiting/collection hours or appointment expectations are provided; technical message guidance can be more concrete.','F01, F04, F09, F18, F23–F24: complete notices, simplify the initial form, add autofill/telephone semantics and test real delivery in an authorized environment.')
page('Page findings: shop and category routes',kicker='CATALOGUE PROMISE VERSUS REAL AVAILABILITY')
review('Webshop','https://nextro.hu/bolt/','Browse and compare the catalogue, then purchase or enquire.','Nine charger variants are discoverable, category navigation is visible and a sort control exists. Main shop description names the actual charger range.','Generic title; duplicate shop entry across sitemaps. Eight zero-product category destinations remain indexable and linked.','Only one product has a price/add-to-cart; eight show read-more. Price filtering is of limited value for this price configuration.','Consistent grid but inconsistent lifestyle crops and long near-identical titles complicate comparisons. “Price:” is left in English.','The broad HVAC-store implication exceeds the purchasable catalogue seen. Empty-category fallback copy exists, so these are not literal blank pages.','F02–F03, F10, F13: explicitly separate online purchases from quote ranges, approve commercial states, add comparison attributes and simplify secondary shop actions.')
review('Air handlers: representative empty category','https://nextro.hu/termekkategoria/legkezelok/','Offer air handlers or capture equipment-specific quotations.','Intro explains new equipment/installation and provides a phone/contact fallback rather than only a no-results message.','No H1 or meta description; title ends “Archives”; indexable despite an empty catalogue. The same no-H1 issue affects five other categories.','“Still being uploaded” and “no displayable product” are an unfinished-store message. EV chargers under popular products distract from air-handler intent.','Category navigation occupies space without advancing this task; the empty-state hierarchy should instead emphasize a specification request.','“A kategória termékei még nem tölthetők fel” sounds like an implementation limitation, not customer guidance.','F03, F10–F11: make this a purposeful quote-led page with device/application data, scope and a targeted CTA—or temporarily remove unfinished commerce navigation.')
p('<b>Peer coverage:</b> /automatika/, /alkatreszek/, /futoegysegek/, /legfuggonyok/ and /szurok/ also lack H1s. /parasitok/ is empty but does have an H1. All eight category pages lack meta descriptions. These distinctions come from the complete category crawl, not extrapolation from one page.','small')
page('Page findings: charger category and product',kicker='SELECTION AND ENQUIRY-ONLY STATE')
review('EV charger category','https://nextro.hu/termekkategoria/autotoltok/','Compare power and cable options across the nine Teltonika EVC2 variants.','Introduction specifies 7.4/11/22 kW, phases, IP56, app/NFC, warranty and VAT versus installation scope.','H1 is present but description metadata is absent and title is an English archive default. Product-to-category internal links exist.','No concise variant matrix; most items do not show a price or availability explanation. One priced item makes the others look incomplete.','Grid fits mobile; long names and varying image compositions make scanning harder. The category strip also exposes seven zero-product ranges.','Technical feature density is useful but needs plain-language selection advice: supply phases, cable need, site capacity and installation assessment.','F02, F10, F13: add a visible comparison table, intentional quote/purchase states and a tailored Hungarian search snippet.')
review('11 kW / 5 m: sampled unpriced product','https://nextro.hu/termek/teltonika-evc2-okos-ac-autotolto-11-kw-5-m-beepitett-toltokabellel/','Explain one charger configuration and convert product interest.','Specific product heading and short summary; cable, phases and 36-month warranty are mentioned; image alt text is descriptive.','No meta description and no Product JSON-LD in the parsed page. Shared technical text limits differentiation, although the variant is real.','No price or buy control; the separate “Contact us now” panel offers a generic installation enquiry, not an obvious model-specific request.','Image and summary establish a product layout, but the commercial next step is visually subordinate to wishlist/compare and long text.','Shipping tab contains the same internal missing-information note found in all nine product HTML pages. General network wording should be reviewed for model-specific clarity.','F01–F02, F13, F16, F20: label quotation mode, place a Hungarian contextual quote CTA beside the summary, publish approved delivery terms and accurate product facts.')
page('Page findings: priced product and policies',kicker='PURCHASE-READINESS BLOCKERS')
review('22 kW / 7.5 m: priced product','https://nextro.hu/termek/teltonika-evc2-okos-ac-autotolto-22-kw-75-m-beepitett-toltokabellel/','Support a direct product purchase with optional installation.','Visible 99 999 Ft price, quantity/add-to-cart and Product/Offer JSON-LD. Offer markup matches the displayed price and says InStock.','No meta description; structured data presence is not a Rich Results Test pass. Price/stock correctness is a business validation task, not independently proven by matching markup.','The shipping tab exposes “[HIÁNYZIK: a konkrét szállítási díjak, határidők …]” and links to an unfinished policy. No order was placed.','Wide landscape product image and dense summary compete with the selection task; green breadcrumbs/tabs trigger contrast findings.','Shared features do not clearly separate included product, installation, delivery and optional equipment at the point of purchase.','F01–F02, F04, F13, F16, F24: approve transaction terms/stock/price, show total-cost scope, improve product media/specifications and run an authorized checkout test.')
sub('Privacy, terms and shipping information')
url('https://nextro.hu/adatkezelesi-tajekoztato/  •  https://nextro.hu/aszf/  •  https://nextro.hu/fizetesi-es-szallitasi-tajekoztato/')
p('<b>Purpose:</b> Explain data handling and contractual/delivery conditions. <b>Strength:</b> These destinations exist and are consistently linked. <b>SEO:</b> Each returns 200 and is indexable; descriptions repeat “feltöltés alatt” placeholder wording. <b>UX:</b> The user cannot inspect what the form asks them to accept. <b>UI:</b> A clean template cannot compensate for absent policy substance. <b>Content:</b> Main content consists of a short “currently being uploaded; return later” statement. <b>Action:</b> F01 is CRITICAL. Publish approved policies and remove internal notes before conversion-focused promotion; a qualified adviser must assess legal obligations.','small')
page('Page findings: company details and recovery',kicker='POSITIVE FOUNDATIONS TO PRESERVE')
review('Impresszum','https://nextro.hu/impresszum/','Identify the operator and hosting provider.','NEXTRO name, Budapest address, email, tax number, company registration and registering court are present; hosting provider details are supplied.','Specific title/description and H1 are present. The shared Organization JSON-LD could reuse confirmed visible details.','Company identity is reachable from the footer, supporting trust. It does not replace the incomplete privacy/contract/delivery policies.','Plain text company details are readable; template phrasing such as company/sole-trader alternatives can be tailored.','Values were observed but not independently reconciled with a registry. Registered address is distinct from the contact page’s Szentendre warehouse.','F16, F18, F20: retain transparency, confirm accuracy, streamline template labels and align verified business data consistently across site/listings.')
review('Empty cart and 404 recovery','https://nextro.hu/kosar/ ; https://nextro.hu/technical-audit-not-found-20260922-7e21/','Recover empty-shopping and nonexistent-page journeys.','Cart explains that it is empty and offers continue shopping. The 404 offers home/contact links and a clear Hungarian explanation.','Cart is noindex/follow but included in the sitemap; 404 returns an actual 404/noindex response. Empty-session checkout redirects to cart.','Recovery is clear. This test does not prove add-to-cart persistence, populated checkout, payments or confirmation delivery.','Both use the shared clean template; no severe layout defect was observed in these states.','Error copy is understandable and avoids blaming the user. No additional promotional text is needed here.','F12: clean sitemap utility entries. F24: validate the full authorized transaction journey later; preserve real 404 status and the existing recovery links.')
